      ":question/problem": "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=-2 \\\\ {x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$",
